          "probability"
        ],
        "title": "SalientLogit",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SteerFeature": {
        "description": "One feature intervention.\n\nThese field names are public: ``/api/steer-logits`` documents them in its swagger and\nforwards the array here untouched, so renaming one is an API break.",
